sequenceDiagram
    participant VM as ViewModel
    participant Api as ApiClient (OkHttp)
    participant Auth as TokenRefreshAuthenticator
    participant API as MedRational API

    VM->>Api: request
    Api->>API: Authorization: Bearer JWT
    API-->>Api: 401 (JWT expired)
    Api->>Auth: authenticate()
    Auth->>API: POST /auth/refresh {refreshToken}
    alt renewal accepted
        API-->>Auth: new JWT + refresh token
        Auth->>Auth: save them (TokenManager)
        Auth-->>Api: same request with the new JWT
        Api->>API: retry once
        API-->>VM: 200
    else renewal refused (401)
        Auth->>Auth: clear the session
        Auth-->>VM: user must sign in again
    else offline or server error
        Auth-->>VM: error shown, session kept
    end
